{"title":"Don’t Tell Me You Think Cultivating Immortality Is Difficult?","synopsis":"Seorang pemula yang rendah hati mencari jalan menuju keabadian. Namun, ia secara tidak sengaja bergabung dengan sekte yang penuh dengan penipu ulung. Tujuh saudara seniornya dipenuhi dengan kepercayaan diri, bergantian melontarkan teknik-teknik magis yang dibuat-buat. Namun, tak seorang pun menyangka pendatang baru ini seorang jenius. Ia benar-benar memahami segalanya — bahkan omong kosong mereka! Pada akhirnya, sang guru jatuh dalam keputusasaan. Siapakah sebenarnya murid junior ini?","alternative_title":"不会真有人觉得修仙难吧","author":"黑夜弥天, 齐茯","artist":"JZ","genres":["Action","Comedy","Fantasy","Martial Arts"],"chapters":[{"id":"81229d64-a249-4198-8dc5-9e0eea2521f7","number":"46","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-01-22","images":[]},{"id":"db6dbdbf-6ae8-41f6-b707-cf252e025514","number":"45","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-01-15","images":[]},{"id":"b46179f5-f2df-48e5-be42-44d5ad057eae","number":"44","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2025-12-23","images":[]},{"id":"1e9c4b37-3f34-4093-ae97-aee712afdf5d","number":"43","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2025-12-23","images":[]},{"id":"37d78204-ea06-4112-8d18-88579fc09b6c","number":"42","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2025-12-23","images":[]},{"id":"b7e7ab48-a7ae-4874-af3b-296d75942572","number":"41","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2025-12-21","images":[]},{"id":"79d3a6a7-c5ec-426c-95e4-67f8ccdd00a7","number":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2025-12-21","images":[]},{"id":"9e3eba60-c409-4da6-a020-195438cc1593","number":"39","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2025-11-29","images":[]},{"id":"4d64fa65-b4c6-4490-abf1-ca577167f596","number":"38","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2025-11-24","images":[]},{"id":"493e4ae4-fede-4437-a445-599f661cba6d","number":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2025-11-24","images":[]},{"id":"038af5ab-c1dc-46af-8a5b-c6adffe4fd34","number":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2025-11-24","images":[]},{"id":"800d1acc-f94d-4edf-907d-056b6277e241","n